    "clinicalAlerts": "> [!WARNING]\n> • If urine creatinine is ordered along with chloride, the urine should be kept refrig-\n> erated during collection.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"test-89-cholangiography-bile-duct-a-ray-percutaneous-transhepatic-cholangiogram-operative-cholangiogram-t-tube-cholangiogram\"></a>",
