    "abnormalFindings": [
      "Inadequate placental reserve"
    ],
    "contributingFactors": "• Maternal hypotension may cause a false-positive test result.",
    "clinicalAlerts": "> [!WARNING]\n> • Possible complication: Premature labor\n> • It is recommended that the contraction stress test not be done until at least\n> the thirty-fourth week of gestation to improve chances of fetal survival\n> should delivery occur prematurely.",
