    "contributingFactors": "• Factors which may increase 2,3-DPG levels: high altitudes, strenuous exercise.\n• Factors which may decrease 2,3-DPG levels: acidosis, receipt of banked blood.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"test-124-disseminated-intravascular-coagulation-screening\"></a>",
