    "clinicalAlerts": "> [!WARNING]\n> • Potential complication: with liver dysfunction, patient may have prolonged clot-\n> ting time.\n> • Teach the patient to monitor the site. If the site begins to bleed, the patient should\n> apply direct pressure and, if unable to control the bleeding, return to the laboratory\n> or notify the nurse.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"test-163-gastric-emptying-scan\"></a>",
