    "clinicalAlerts": "> [!WARNING]\n> • A helpful table for interpreting Hepatitis B tests can be found at the website for\n> the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention, National Center for Infectious\n> Diseases at: http://www.cdc.gov/ncidod/diseases/hepatitis/b/Bserology.htm.\n> • Close monitoring of patients with hepatitis is needed regarding liver function and\n> continuation of treatment regimens, when appropriate.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"test-183-herpes-simplex-antibody-herpes-simplex-virus-hsv-hsv-1-hsv-2-herpesvirus\"></a>",
    "contraindications": ""
