    "contributingFactors": "• Hemolysis of the sample will alter test results.",
    "clinicalAlerts": "> [!WARNING]\n> • Explain to the pregnant patient that, should genital herpes be present at the time\n> of delivery, cesarean section may be necessary.\n> • Sexual partners of patients testing positive for HSV-2 should also be tested.\n> Education is needed regarding prevention of transmission, treatment during\n> active infection, and suppression therapy.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"test-184-hexosaminidase\"></a>",
