    "description": "Nasopharyngeal culture involves obtaining a sample of secretions from the\nnasopharynx. The sample is then grown in a culture medium. The type of organism\nis identified, and if appropriate, the culture can be used to then determine which\nantibiotic therapy will be effective against the organism (sensitivity testing).",
