    "decreased": [],
    "abnormalFindings": [],
    "contributingFactors": "• Hemolysis of the blood sample and lipemia may alter test results.\n• Drugs which may decrease protein C levels: antibiotics, asparaginase, estrogens,\nheparin, warfarin.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"test-277-protein-electrophoresis-serum-protein-electrophoresis-spep-immunofixation-electrophoresis-ife-total-protein\"></a>",
