    "abnormalFindings": [],
    "contributingFactors": "• Hemolysis of the blood sample may alter test results.\n• Drugs that may decrease protein S levels: asparaginase, oral contraceptives,\nwarfarin.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"test-279-prothrombin-fragment-1\"></a>",
    "clinicalAlerts": "",
