    "contraindications": "- Pregnant women\n- Caution: A woman in her childbearing years should undergo scanning only dur-\n- ing her menses or 12 to 14 days after its onset to avoid any exposure to a fetus.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"test-305-sodium-blood\"></a>"
