    "contributingFactors": "• Contamination of the specimen, collection of saliva rather than sputum, and delay\nin specimen delivery to laboratory can alter test results.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"test-310-stool-culture-stool-for-ova-parasites\"></a>",
