    "clinicalAlerts": "> [!WARNING]\n> • Resources for patients with cystic fibrosis and their families are available from\n> the Cystic Fibrosis Foundation (www.cff.org).\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"test-313-syphilis-serology\"></a>",
