    "contributingFactors": "• Too rapid movement of capsule through the GI tract may provide inadequate visu-\nalization of the entire small intestine.\n• Very slow movement of the capsule through the small intestine may prevent the\nentire small intestine from being visualized before the battery pack shuts down.",
