    "clinicalAlerts": "> [!WARNING]\n> • Whenever a viral etiology is suspected and whenever appropriate, acute and con-\n> valescent serum should be collected for viral serology tests.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"test-355-vitamin-b12\"></a>",
