    "clinicalAlerts": "> [!WARNING]\n> • Patients who continue to be symptomatic despite treatment should be retested,\n> along with obtaining a vaginal culture.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"test-358-white-blood-cell-count-and-differential-basophil-count-eosinophil-count-leukocyte-count-lymphocyte-count-monocyte-count-neutrophil-count-wbc-count-and-differential\"></a>",
